 favorites: 9; remixes: 2.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nPeakpath Sleep Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nPeakPath Home About Blog Book a demo Sleep better. Stay focused. Think sharper. PeakPath helps Big-3 and Big-4 pros boost performance with coaching, wearables, and habit tools. Book a demo Better Sleep 10 minutes for in…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Sleep better. Stay focused. Think sharper..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #C9F46B, secondary #000000, accent #A7FFD0, background #03110E, surface #F6F0DD, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse IBM Plex Mono for display moments and Instrument Serif for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use IBM Plex Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>PeakPath | Performance Coaching</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Sora', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Instrument Serif', 'serif'],\n                        mono: ['IBM Plex Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --forest: #03110E;\n            --deep: #061915;\n            --moss: #C9F46B;\n            --mint: #A7FFD0;\n            --cream: #F6F0DD;\n            --sage: #829A89;\n            --amber: #E7B76A;\n            --clay: #D86F45;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html,\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            min-height: 100%;\n            background: var(--forest);\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;\n            color: var(--cream);\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(201,244,107,0.10), transparent 30%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 12% 78%, rgba(167,255,208,0.10), transparent 30%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 70%, rgba(231,183,106,0.08), transparent 32%),\n                linear-gradient(180deg, #03110E 0%, #061915 55%, #020706 100%);\n        }\n\n        .font-serif {\n            font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;\n        }\n\n        .font-mono {\n            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        .background-grid {\n            background-image:\n                linear-gradient(rgba(246,240,221,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(246,240,221,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 76px 76px;\n            mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 0%, transparent 75%);\n        }\n\n        .noise-overlay {\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.09;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 220 220' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.88' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.48'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n        }\n\n        .glass {\n            background: rgba(246,240,221,0.045);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(246,240,221,0.095);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.055),\n                0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);\n        }\n\n        .glass-strong {\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(246,240,221,0.065), rgba(246,240,221,0.022)),\n                rgba(3,17,14,0.48);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(246,240,221,0.105);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.055),\n                0 34px 120px rgba(0,0,0,0.38),\n                0 0 80px rgba(201,244,107,0.07);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n        }\n\n        .metric-pill {\n            background: rgba(3,17,14,0.52);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(246,240,221,0.10);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.045),\n                0 12px 38px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n        }\n\n        .status-dot {\n            width: 6px;\n            height: 6px;\n            border-radius: 999px;\n            background: var(--moss);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(201,244,107,0.9);\n        }\n\n        .diagonal-band {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: -18% -10%;\n            z-index: 1;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            transform: rotate(-14deg);\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(\n                    90deg,\n                    transparent 0%,\n                    rgba(201,244,107,0.06) 18%,\n                    rgba(167,255,208,0.16) 43%,\n                    rgba(231,183,106,0.14) 56%,\n                    rgba(201,244,107,0.06) 72%,\n                    transparent 100%\n                );\n            filter: blur(42px);\n            opacity: 0.92;\n        }\n\n        .diagonal-line {\n            position: fixed;\n            left: -10%;\n            right: -10%;\n            height: 1px;\n            z-index: 2;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            transform: rotate(-14deg);\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(246,240,221,0.24), rgba(201,244,107,0.36), transparent);\n            opacity: 0.55;\n        }\n\n        .reveal-word,\n        .reveal-line,\n        .reveal-pill,\n        .reveal-card {\n            will-change: transform, opacity, filter;\n        }\n\n        .progressive-blur {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: auto 0 0 0;\n            z-index: 5;\n            height: 30%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .progressive-blur {\n                height: 22%;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#03110E] text-[#F6F0DD] antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#C9F46B] selection:text-[#03110E]\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Diagonal Background Composition -->\n    <div class=\"diagonal-band\"></div>\n    <div class=\"diagonal-line top-[28%]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"diagonal-line top-[64%] opacity-30\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Static Background Layers -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[2] pointer-events-none background-grid opacity-65\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[3] pointer-events-none noise-overlay\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Corner Frame -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[4] pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-5 left-5 w-5 h-5 border-t border-l border-white/12\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-5 right-5 w-5 h-5 border-t border-r border-white/12\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 w-5 h-5 border-b border-l border-white/12\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 w-5 h-5 border-b border-r border-white/12\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/[0.022]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/[0.018]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Progressive Blur -->\n    <div class=\"progressive-blur\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; backdrop-filter:blur(0.5px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(0.5px); mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%); -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%); z-index:1;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; backdrop-filter:blur(1px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px); mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%); -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%); z-index:2;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; backdrop-filter:blur(2px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(2px); mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%); -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%); z-index:3;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; backdrop-filter:blur(4px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px); mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%); -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%); z-index:4;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; backdrop-filter:blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px); mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%); -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%); z-index:5;\"></div>\n       